---
config:
  layout: elk
  look: neo
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  title: GUI-3 - Provisional ballot bar chart (required)
  actor User as User

  box Frontend
    participant landingPage as landingPage#58;DOMNode
    participant chart as chart#58;DOMNode

    participant Axios as #58;Axios
  end

  box Backend
    participant Controller as #58;Controller
    participant Service as #58;Service
    participant Repository as #58;Repository
  end
  
  Note right of Repository: IStateDAO in codebase

  Note right of User: Visits state/{fipsCode}
  activate landingPage
  User ->>+ landingPage: Click State

  activate chart
  landingPage ->>+ chart: Render

  Note right of chart: Orval used to generate typesafe request wrappers
  chart ->>+ Axios: getProvisionalBallots(fipsCode, 2024, true)

  Axios ->> Controller: GET /state/{fipsCode}/provisional_ballots?aggregate=true
  Axios ->>+ Controller: getProvisionalBallots(fipsCode, year=2024, aggregate=true)

  Note left of Controller: year=2024, is a default query parameter
  Note left of Controller: The Servelet + Jackson Serialization step is omitted for simplicity. <br> The full event flow is in our diagram for GUI-2: Display State
  
  Controller ->>+ Service: getProvisionalBallots(fipsCode, year=2024, aggregate=true)
  Service ->>+ Repository: getProvisionalBallots(fipsCode, year=2024, aggregate=true)
  
  Note left of Repository: Calls into our custom ORM solution, performing row mapping <br> (simplified, full-flow in GUI-2: Display State)
  Repository -->>- Service: List<ProvisionalBallotStatisticsModel>
  
  Service -->>- Controller: List<ProvisionalBallotStatisticsModel>

  Note left of Controller: Serialized into a JSON string
  Controller -->>- Axios: HTTP 200 OK: JSONString

  Axios -->>- chart: List<ProvisionalBallotStatisticsModel>
  Note left of chart: Bar chart data set from server response object<br>and dynamically sized using D3
  deactivate chart

  deactivate landingPage
  